---
import { Icon } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
---

<section class="intro not-content">
  <h2>Install, learn and fix the Helix tools</h2>
  <p>
    Each tool’s pages come from its latest release and refresh every day. Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>K</kbd> on any
    page to search all of them.
  </p>
  <a class="start" href="/toolbox/walkthrough/">Start with Helix Toolbox <Icon name="right-arrow" size="1rem" /></a>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 35%, transparent);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background-color: var(--sl-color-accent-low);
  }
  .intro h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--__sl-font);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  p {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-1);
  }
  kbd {
    padding: 0.05em 0.35em;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-family: var(--__sl-font);
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }
  .start {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-black) 45%, var(--sl-color-accent-low));
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .start {
    background-color: var(--sl-color-accent);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .start:hover,
  :global(:root[data-theme='light']) .start:hover {
    background-color: var(--sl-color-black);
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }
</style>
